data/*.tsv.zst: game titles, IDs, regions, release dates, developers,
publishers and classification tags

Source: GameDataBase by PigSaint, https://github.com/PigSaint/GameDataBase.
The upstream commit and its date are recorded in data/VERSION.
scripts/gamedatabase regenerates the files from a checkout of that commit and
is the preferred form for modifying them.

Changes made to the upstream data: the "Title (exact)" and "Title screen
(exact)" columns and the four file-hash columns are removed; the eight arcade
manufacturer files are merged into one; whitespace inside a cell is collapsed
to single spaces; and each file is re-encoded as tab-separated text and
compressed with Zstandard. Rows and the remaining cells are otherwise as
upstream publishes them.

